# Patterns that are themselves safe to publish. One extended regex per line,
# matched case-insensitively. See patterns.local.example for the private list.

# Session transcript URLs. This repo is public; the transcript is not, and the
# harness will offer a Claude-Session: trailer that must never be accepted.
claude\.ai/code/session_[A-Za-z0-9_-]+

# Scratchpad paths leak the machine layout and the session id in the path.
/private/tmp/claude-[0-9]+/
